# The build stage is `COPY . .`, so everything not listed here is copied into it
# on every build. None of it reaches the shipped image — the distroless stage
# takes only the binary and an empty /data — but it is copied and it invalidates
# the layer cache, and it leaves a dev database one stray COPY away from the
# final image. Measured before this file existed: 33MB of context, 19MB of which
# was `bin/`, which the container rebuilds from source anyway.
#
# NARROW ON PURPOSE — do not add sweeping patterns here. `web/assets` is embedded
# with `//go:embed all:assets`, and `all:` takes dotfiles and READMEs along with
# everything else: `web/assets/img/README.md` carries the Milky Way image's
# licence and ships inside the binary, as does the providers directory's
# attribution note. A `*.md` or `.*` rule would drop them silently — the build
# would still succeed, and the licence would simply stop being distributed with
# the thing it licenses. Exclude by name, never by sweep.

# Host build output. Rebuilt inside the container; the single largest item here.
bin
dist

# Local dev database and run log (see `make dev`). Never belongs in an image.
.devdata
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# History: read by people, not by the compiler. Mostly a 3MB poster.
specs

# Repository and tooling state.
.git
.gitignore
.github
.dockerignore

# Local agent and editor state. AGENTS.md is a local, untracked mirror of
# CLAUDE.md; neither is a build input.
.claude
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.DS_Store
node_modules
